<title>CHILE: Top buyers of Codelco copper this year detailed.</title>
<headline>Top buyers of Codelco copper this year detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the top buyers of Codelco's refined copper this year.</p>
<p>This includes cathodes and fire-refined copper.</p>
<p> Country/region	    No of clients	 Sales (tonnes)</p>
<p> ASIA			  48			527,389</p>
<p> South Korea		  8			136,066</p>
<p> Taiwan			 3			 86,400</p>
<p> Japan			 20			 57,200</p>
<p> India			  2			 32,000</p>
<p> Malaysia		     4			 24,500</p>
<p> Indonesia		    4			 19,900</p>
<p> Others						    9,759</p>
<p> Traders						 161,573</p>
<p> EUROPE			45			359,910</p>
<p> France			 6			112,102</p>
<p> Italy			 24			 93,085</p>
<p> Germany			5			 67,803</p>
<p> Great Britain		6			 46,500</p>
<p> Greece			 2			 11,018</p>
<p> Others						    8,500</p>
<p> Traders						  20,902</p>
<p> LATIN AMERICA	     39			104,726</p>
<p> Chile			 14			 66,661</p>
<p> Brazil			10			 20,834</p>
<p> Argentina		   12			 15,231</p>
<p> Venezuela		    3			  2,000</p>
<p> NORTH AMERICA		9			 46,884</p>
<p> United States		9			 20,339</p>
<p> Traders						  26,545</p>
<p> Australia		    1			  8,257</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
